You learn to maintain your agility and manage your combat posture while wearing robes or light armour.  When wearing armour no heavier than leather in your main body slot, you gain [29, 36, 41, 46, 50 (TL1-5; DEX 100)] Defense, [5%, 14%, 21%, 27%, 32% (TL1-5)] Armour hardiness, and [9%, 15%, 19%, 22%, 25% (TL1-5)] reduced Fatigue.

In addition, when you step adjacent to a (visible) enemy, you use the juxtaposition to increase your total Defense by [14, 18, 20, 23, 25 (TL1-5; DEX 100)] for 2 turns.

The Defense bonus scales with your Dexterity.
